      <title>什么是homebrew以及如何使用</title>
      <link href="/2025/03/16/%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AFhomebrew%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/"/>
      <url>/2025/03/16/%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%98%AFhomebrew%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="什么是-Homebrew-以及如何使用"><a href="#什么是-Homebrew-以及如何使用" class="headerlink" title="什么是 Homebrew 以及如何使用"></a>什么是 Homebrew 以及如何使用</h2><h3 id="一、什么是-Homebrew？"><a href="#一、什么是-Homebrew？" class="headerlink" title="一、什么是 Homebrew？"></a>一、什么是 Homebrew？</h3><p><strong>Homebrew</strong> 是 macOS 和 Linux 上的包管理工具，提供了一个简单的方式来安装、管理和卸载各种软件包。它类似于 Linux 中的 <code>apt</code> 或 <code>yum</code>，能够方便地安装开发工具、系统工具、甚至图形界面的应用程序。</p><p>Homebrew 的核心优势包括：</p><ul><li><strong>简便性</strong>：通过简单的命令即可完成软件的安装和管理。</li><li><strong>依赖管理</strong>：自动解决软件包依赖问题。</li><li><strong>社区支持</strong>：拥有庞大的社区，提供了海量的软件包。</li><li><strong>可扩展性</strong>：支持自定义公式（Formula）和拓展插件。</li></ul><h3 id="二、Homebrew-的安装"><a href="#二、Homebrew-的安装" class="headerlink" title="二、Homebrew 的安装"></a>二、Homebrew 的安装</h3><p>在 macOS 或 Linux 中安装 Homebrew 非常简单。</p><h4 id="1-macOS-上安装-Homebrew"><a href="#1-macOS-上安装-Homebrew" class="headerlink" title="1. macOS 上安装 Homebrew"></a><strong>1. macOS 上安装 Homebrew</strong></h4><p>确保已安装 Xcode 命令行工具：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">xcode-select --install</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后运行以下命令来安装 Homebrew：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">/bin/bash -c <span class="string">&quot;<span class="subst">$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)</span>&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装完成后，按照提示将 Homebrew 加入环境变量：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&#x27;eval &quot;$(/opt/homebrew/bin/brew shellenv)&quot;&#x27;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.zprofile</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="2-Linux-上安装-Homebrew"><a href="#2-Linux-上安装-Homebrew" class="headerlink" title="2. Linux 上安装 Homebrew"></a><strong>2. Linux 上安装 Homebrew</strong></h4><p>同样可以通过以下命令进行安装：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">/bin/bash -c <span class="string">&quot;<span class="subst">$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)</span>&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后将 Homebrew 加入到环境变量中：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">echo</span> <span class="string">&#x27;eval &quot;$(/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/brew shellenv)&quot;&#x27;</span> &gt;&gt; ~/.bashrc</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">source</span> ~/.bashrc</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="三、Homebrew-的基本使用"><a href="#三、Homebrew-的基本使用" class="headerlink" title="三、Homebrew 的基本使用"></a>三、Homebrew 的基本使用</h3><p>安装完成后，可以通过 <code>brew</code> 命令执行相关操作。</p><h4 id="1-搜索软件包"><a href="#1-搜索软件包" class="headerlink" title="1. 搜索软件包"></a><strong>1. 搜索软件包</strong></h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew search 软件名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>例如：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew search node</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="2-安装软件包"><a href="#2-安装软件包" class="headerlink" title="2. 安装软件包"></a><strong>2. 安装软件包</strong></h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew install 软件名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>例如：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew install git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="3-卸载软件包"><a href="#3-卸载软件包" class="headerlink" title="3. 卸载软件包"></a><strong>3. 卸载软件包</strong></h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew uninstall 软件名</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="4-更新-Homebrew"><a href="#4-更新-Homebrew" class="headerlink" title="4. 更新 Homebrew"></a><strong>4. 更新 Homebrew</strong></h4><p>保持 Homebrew 和软件包列表的最新：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew update</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="5-升级已安装的软件"><a href="#5-升级已安装的软件" class="headerlink" title="5. 升级已安装的软件"></a><strong>5. 升级已安装的软件</strong></h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew upgrade</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="6-查看已安装的软件包"><a href="#6-查看已安装的软件包" class="headerlink" title="6. 查看已安装的软件包"></a><strong>6. 查看已安装的软件包</strong></h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew list</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="7-清理不再需要的文件"><a href="#7-清理不再需要的文件" class="headerlink" title="7. 清理不再需要的文件"></a><strong>7. 清理不再需要的文件</strong></h4><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew cleanup</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="四、常见问题与解决方法"><a href="#四、常见问题与解决方法" class="headerlink" title="四、常见问题与解决方法"></a>四、常见问题与解决方法</h3><ol><li><p><strong>找不到软件包</strong>：</p><ul><li>运行 <code>brew update</code> 更新包列表。</li><li>确保拼写正确。</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>权限问题</strong>：</p><ul><li>使用 <code>sudo chown -R $(whoami) /usr/local</code> 修复权限。</li></ul></li><li><p><strong>网络问题</strong>：</p><ul><li>尝试切换网络或使用 VPN。</li></ul></li></ol><h3 id="五、总结"><a href="#五、总结" class="headerlink" title="五、总结"></a>五、总结</h3><p>Homebrew 是一个强大的包管理工具，通过简单的命令即可高效地安装和管理软件。对于 macOS 和 Linux 用户来说，掌握 Homebrew 能够大幅提升开发效率。希望这篇博客能帮助你快速上手 Homebrew！</p><p>如果你有任何问题或遇到困难，欢迎留言交流！</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>hexo搭建个人博客及用butterfly主题美化</title>
      <link href="/2025/03/11/hexo%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%8F%8A%E7%94%A8butterfly%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E7%BE%8E%E5%8C%96/"/>
      <url>/2025/03/11/hexo%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%8F%8A%E7%94%A8butterfly%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E7%BE%8E%E5%8C%96/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="Hexo-搭建个人博客及-Butterfly-主题美化"><a href="#Hexo-搭建个人博客及-Butterfly-主题美化" class="headerlink" title="Hexo 搭建个人博客及 Butterfly 主题美化"></a>Hexo 搭建个人博客及 Butterfly 主题美化</h1><h2 id="1-Hexo-简介"><a href="#1-Hexo-简介" class="headerlink" title="1. Hexo 简介"></a>1. Hexo 简介</h2><p>Hexo 是一个快速、简洁且强大的静态博客框架，基于 Node.js 构建，支持 Markdown 语法，适合个人博客和技术文章的发布。</p><h2 id="2-Hexo-安装"><a href="#2-Hexo-安装" class="headerlink" title="2. Hexo 安装"></a>2. Hexo 安装</h2><h3 id="2-1-安装-Node-js-和-Git"><a href="#2-1-安装-Node-js-和-Git" class="headerlink" title="2.1 安装 Node.js 和 Git"></a>2.1 安装 Node.js 和 Git</h3><p>在使用 Hexo 之前，需要先安装 <strong>Node.js</strong> 和 <strong>Git</strong>。</p><ul><li><a href="https://nodejs.org/">Node.js 下载</a>（建议安装 LTS 版本）</li><li><a href="https://git-scm.com/">Git 下载</a></li></ul><p>安装完成后，使用以下命令检查版本：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node -v  <span class="comment"># 检查 Node.js 版本</span></span><br><span class="line">git --version  <span class="comment"># 检查 Git 版本</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-2-安装-Hexo"><a href="#2-2-安装-Hexo" class="headerlink" title="2.2 安装 Hexo"></a>2.2 安装 Hexo</h3><p>使用 npm 安装 Hexo：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装成功后，运行以下命令查看版本：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-初始化-Hexo-博客"><a href="#3-初始化-Hexo-博客" class="headerlink" title="3. 初始化 Hexo 博客"></a>3. 初始化 Hexo 博客</h2><p>进入你想存放博客的文件夹，运行以下命令：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo init myblog  <span class="comment"># 初始化博客</span></span><br><span class="line">dcd myblog  <span class="comment"># 进入博客目录</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install  <span class="comment"># 安装依赖</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="4-安装-Butterfly-主题"><a href="#4-安装-Butterfly-主题" class="headerlink" title="4. 安装 Butterfly 主题"></a>4. 安装 Butterfly 主题</h2><p>Butterfly 是 Hexo 的一款美观且强大的主题。</p><h3 id="4-1-下载-Butterfly-主题"><a href="#4-1-下载-Butterfly-主题" class="headerlink" title="4.1 下载 Butterfly 主题"></a>4.1 下载 Butterfly 主题</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> -b master https://github.com/jerryc127/hexo-theme-butterfly.git themes/butterfly</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-2-配置主题"><a href="#4-2-配置主题" class="headerlink" title="4.2 配置主题"></a>4.2 配置主题</h3><p>修改 Hexo 根目录下的 <code>_config.yml</code> 文件，将 <code>theme</code> 设置为 <code>butterfly</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">butterfly</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="5-主题配置与优化"><a href="#5-主题配置与优化" class="headerlink" title="5. 主题配置与优化"></a>5. 主题配置与优化</h2><p>进入 <code>themes/butterfly/_config.yml</code> 文件，可进行个性化设置。</p><h3 id="5-1-设置站点基本信息"><a href="#5-1-设置站点基本信息" class="headerlink" title="5.1 设置站点基本信息"></a>5.1 设置站点基本信息</h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">favicon:</span> <span class="string">/img/favicon.png</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">avatar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">img:</span> <span class="string">/img/avatar.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">effect:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>  <span class="comment"># 取消头像旋转</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-2-配置导航菜单"><a href="#5-2-配置导航菜单" class="headerlink" title="5.2 配置导航菜单"></a>5.2 配置导航菜单</h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">Home:</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-home</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">Study||fas</span> <span class="attr">fa-book:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">Deep Learning:</span> <span class="string">/deep-learning/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-brain</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">Frontend:</span> <span class="string">/frontend/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-code</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">Life||fas</span> <span class="attr">fa-leaf:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">Music:</span> <span class="string">/music/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-music</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">Movie:</span> <span class="string">/movies/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-film</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">Travel:</span> <span class="string">/travel/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-plane</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">Thoughts:</span> <span class="string">/thoughts/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-pen</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">Personal:</span> <span class="string">/personal/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-user</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-3-文章目录美化"><a href="#5-3-文章目录美化" class="headerlink" title="5.3 文章目录美化"></a>5.3 文章目录美化</h3><p>在 <code>butterfly/_config.yml</code> 中，启用文章目录：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">toc:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">number:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>  <span class="comment"># 显示目录编号</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">expand:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>  <span class="comment"># 默认展开</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="6-Hexo-文章管理"><a href="#6-Hexo-文章管理" class="headerlink" title="6. Hexo 文章管理"></a>6. Hexo 文章管理</h2><h3 id="6-1-创建新文章"><a href="#6-1-创建新文章" class="headerlink" title="6.1 创建新文章"></a>6.1 创建新文章</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-2-文章-Front-Matter-示例"><a href="#6-2-文章-Front-Matter-示例" class="headerlink" title="6.2 文章 Front Matter 示例"></a>6.2 文章 Front Matter 示例</h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">Hexo</span> <span class="string">搭建个人博客</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">date:</span> <span class="number">2025-03-11 20:22:24</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">tags:</span> [<span class="string">Hexo</span>, <span class="string">Butterfly</span>, <span class="string">博客</span>]</span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">categories:</span> [<span class="string">技术</span>]</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="7-部署-Hexo-到-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#7-部署-Hexo-到-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="7. 部署 Hexo 到 GitHub Pages"></a>7. 部署 Hexo 到 GitHub Pages</h2><h3 id="7-1-安装-Hexo-部署插件"><a href="#7-1-安装-Hexo-部署插件" class="headerlink" title="7.1 安装 Hexo 部署插件"></a>7.1 安装 Hexo 部署插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="7-2-配置-config-yml"><a href="#7-2-配置-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="7.2 配置 _config.yml"></a>7.2 配置 <code>_config.yml</code></h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/你的用户名/你的仓库.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">gh-pages</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="7-3-部署到-GitHub"><a href="#7-3-部署到-GitHub" class="headerlink" title="7.3 部署到 GitHub"></a>7.3 部署到 GitHub</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="8-进阶优化"><a href="#8-进阶优化" class="headerlink" title="8. 进阶优化"></a>8. 进阶优化</h2><h3 id="8-1-启用评论（Valine）"><a href="#8-1-启用评论（Valine）" class="headerlink" title="8.1 启用评论（Valine）"></a>8.1 启用评论（Valine）</h3><p>修改 <code>butterfly/_config.yml</code>，添加 Valine 配置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">valine:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">appId:</span> <span class="string">your-appId</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">appKey:</span> <span class="string">your-appKey</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">avatar:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;retro&#x27;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="8-2-启用代码高亮（PrismJS）"><a href="#8-2-启用代码高亮（PrismJS）" class="headerlink" title="8.2 启用代码高亮（PrismJS）"></a>8.2 启用代码高亮（PrismJS）</h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">prismjs:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">preprocess:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">line_number:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="9-结语"><a href="#9-结语" class="headerlink" title="9. 结语"></a>9. 结语</h2><p>至此，你已经成功搭建了 Hexo 博客并使用 Butterfly 主题进行美化，并完成 GitHub Pages 部署！🎉</p>]]></content>
      
      
